  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of CDC&apos;s Capital Increase: Financial Institutions Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this Financial Institutions evaluation is to better understand the development outcomes and impacts associated with British International Investment&apos;s (BII) investments in the financial sector. Its key components include:
A rapid review of BII&#x2019;s portfolio in the financial institutions sector; A targeted review and mapping of the evidence base on the impacts of financial institutions underpinning the work of BII and its investees; and, A series of four to seven in-depth studies.</narrative>
  </description>
